WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.800
In the spring of 1644, Li Zicheng led a great army and arrived outside the city of Beijing.

2
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:11.440
The defenders on the city walls looked at the army outside the city and felt very nervous.

3
00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:16.240
The tall city gate slowly opened, and the peasant army marched into the city in neat ranks.

4
00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:20.200
The soldiers marched in orderly steps, and both sides of the street were completely quiet.

5
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:25.280
Inside the Forbidden City there was total silence; the vast palaces had lost their former majesty.

6
00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:30.160
Sunlight shone on the golden roofs, and the palaces seemed especially quiet.

7
00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:35.520
The Ming dynasty's rule in Beijing formally came to an end on this very day.

8
00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:41.960
The common people stood quietly at the side of the street watching, feeling both nervous and full of expectation.

9
00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:47.840
An old grandfather held his little grandson's hand and whispered that the times had changed.

10
00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:53.240
Chinese history turned a new page, entering the dramatic transition between the Ming and Qing dynasties.

11
00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:58.800
Morning light illuminated the streets of Beijing, and a new era had begun.
